        "semantic_kind": "table_row",
        "source_locator": "SDD line 947",
        "original_text": "| B1 Parameter | threshold、period、score、frequency | Human Approval、diff、試験 |"
      },
      {
        "coverage_id": "SDD-L0948",
        "semantic_kind": "table_row",
        "source_locator": "SDD line 948",
        "original_text": "| B2 Component | Agent、Skill、Scanner、Watch module | 同上 |"
      },
      {
        "coverage_id": "SDD-L0949",
        "semantic_kind": "table_row",
        "source_locator": "SDD line 949",
        "original_text": "| B3 Architecture | Workflow、Agent graph、System structure | 同上 |"
