        "semantic_kind": "table_row",
        "source_locator": "SDD line 950",
        "original_text": "| B4 Objective | Objective、評価関数、Risk / Return / Income / Human Load | 旧Objectiveを凍結保持し、新旧を並行測定後に再度Human Approval |"
      },
      {
        "coverage_id": "SDD-L0952",
        "semantic_kind": "データ",
        "source_locator": "SDD line 952",
        "original_text": "すべてのBreak Proposalはchange_id、対象版、完全diff、変更後hash、理由、期待効果、影響Strategy、試験計画、rollbackを持つ。"
