      {
        "coverage_id": "SDD-L0956",
        "semantic_kind": "境界",
        "source_locator": "SDD line 956",
        "original_text": "RollbackはCode / Policy / 将来処理を対象とし、実約定、Cash、監査履歴を過去snapshotで上書きしない。"
